      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Mathias finds Hippolyte taking wine at home. When the conversation turns to Camille, Mathias becomes afraid that his son and his secret daughter are seeing each other. He avoids telling the truth about the family connection and invents another reason to keep them apart. Listen to the French first and follow the questions and evasions.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
