      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "A noise interrupts the quiet house. Mathias goes to find out what Hippolyte is doing.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "catherine",
      "t": "C'est quoi ça?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What's that?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Reste là, je vais voir.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stay there, I'll go and see.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "hippolyte",
      "t": "Tu m'as fait peur!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You scared me!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Qu'est-ce que tu fais?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What are you doing?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "hippolyte",
      "t": "Rien, j'avais un peu soif.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nothing, I was a bit thirsty.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "hippolyte",
      "t": "Mes amis sont passés, on n'avait rien à boire.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My friends came round, we had nothing to drink.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Tu es avec Camille?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you with Camille?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "hippolyte",
      "t": "Non. Pourquoi tu demandes?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No. Why do you ask?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Pour rien.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No reason.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "hippolyte",
      "t": "Si! Elle t'a dit quelque chose?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is a reason! Did she tell you something?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Non. Mais elle n'est pas faite pour toi.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No. But she's not right for you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "hippolyte",
      "t": "Explique-moi ça.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Explain that to me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Méfie-toi d'elle. Elle ne t'a pas tout dit.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Be careful with her. She did not tell you everything.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "hippolyte",
      "t": "Tu me fais peur, Papa. Quoi?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You're scaring me, Dad. What?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Elle a un petit ami. Il vient à l'agence.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
